    <briefdescription>
<para>DistributedTraceSpan class for Wave D Phase 2A observability. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>2.4.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-08-17</para>
</simplesect>
Provides a W3C Trace Context-compliant span implementation with baggage propagation, event recording, and low-overhead instrumentation for distributed tracing in ThemisDB.</para>
<para>Wave D Phase 2A Gate: W4A-TRACE-01 (overhead ≤ 2% vs baseline)</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ulink url="https://www.w3.org/TR/trace-context/">https://www.w3.org/TR/trace-context/</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
